n pride i mean ruto was a pretty  spunky individual when she was younger  and she might be embarrassed if people  found out that she crafted this  intricate romantic gesture zora armor  for a hylian man that never came back to  her same as mifa so instead she decided  to place the armor in a hidden grave and  claim that her quote unquote husband  crafted it for the hero but that's  enough speculation for now i'll admit  this isn't a foolproof theory at least  not yet but i do definitely think that  rutela is either ruto herself or her  immediate daughter ultimately because of  the short amount of time in between  games but if she were her daughter then  you'd have to answer where ruto is and  who the father is and that's just a  whole other speculative theory in and of  itself that's even harder to believe  this has been of course just my theory  what did you guys think is rutella  actually ruto who crafted the zora armor  for the hero of time who never came back  for her or is rutella the result of some  good old zora lore retconning from  nintendo let me know in the comments  below also thank you so much for  watching i really enjoyed delving into  twilight princess again since it's one  of my all-time favorite games so please  consider leaving a like if you also  enjoyed this video and remember to  subscribe if you haven't already because  really you're going to want to stick  around i make videos about all sorts of  amazing franchises all of which are  pretty interesting huge thanks of course  to my bandit crew and a warm welcome to  lord omega who just joined up if you're  interested in doing the same please  check out the join button or patreon  links in the description below that's  all i've got for this one so as always i  hope you have a wonderful rest of your  day this is maskington abandoned looking  forward to seeing you next time and  signing out  [Music]  me
 

